## Data

This analysis uses publicly available proteomics data from: Kjærgaard et al., Cell 2025 (https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2025.05.005)

Download the following files from the original repository and place them
in a `data/` folder before running the script:
- corrected_prot.rds
- Sample_ID_prot.rds

https://github.com/fpm-cbmr/KI_study_JKL/tree/master/data
